&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:54pt;min-height:54pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:14.3pt;padding-right:5.4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-8.9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:13pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・お客様が足を運びたくなる沿線拠点&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:9.8pt;padding-right:5.4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-4.4pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:13pt;font-size:13pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:14.3pt;padding-right:5.4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-8.9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:13pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・多世代が交流・共生し、住民が増加、企業も集まる沿線&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:9.8pt;padding-right:5.4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-4.4pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:13pt;font-size:13pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:14.3pt;padding-right:5.4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-8.9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:13pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・暮らしやすく、愛着を持ってもらえるまちづくり&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:19.9pt;min-height:19.9pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:5.4pt;padding-right:10.8pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;line-height:13pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;③幸せな暮らし&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
